  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assiut Oil Refinery Upgrade Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to  meet the growing demand of gasoline products in the southern governorates of Egypt through local production by enhancing the technological capacity of the existing Assiut refinery to utilize the refinery&apos;s own produced Naphtha in an efficient, cost effective and environmentally friendly manner.</narrative>
  </description>
